Open-ended LLM-MASs are Also Susceptible.
LLM-MASs are increasingly being used for open-
ended chat and complex societal simulations. To
assess their vulnerability, we investigate the impact
of injecting the CORBA attack into these systems.
As shown in Fig. 2, our attack is not only faster but
also more robust than baseline methods, achieving
nearly 100% P-ASR within just 20 turns. We also
attempt to apply commonly used safety defense
methods to detect and mitigate C ORBA .
5.3 To what extent can existing defense
methods resist LLM-MAS blocking
attack?
Various safeguard mechanisms have been devel-
oped to protect LLMs (Xu et al., 2024; Yi et al.,
