defending against jailbreak attacks (Deng et al.,
2023; Zou et al., 2023; Zeng et al., 2024a) and
ensuring safety. However, little attention has been
paid to mitigating LLM blocking attacks. To ad-
dress this gap, we conduct experiments to assess
whether existing defenses can effectively counter6902

