a binary tree where each non-leaf node vihas
at most two child nodes v2i+1andv2i+2.
•Random. LetV={v1, ..., v n}be the set
of Agents (n≥2), for any two nodes vi, vj
(i̸=j), an edge (vi, vj)is independently con-
nected with probability p(0< p < 1). The
edge set E⊆(vi, vj)|1≤i < j≤n, where
